sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant E as AI Engine (Python)
  participant R as Redis Streams
  participant S as Asynchronous Sink
  participant P as PostgreSQL 16
  participant G as WebSocket Gateway
  participant N as Outbox Notifier
  participant U as React Command Center

  Note over E,U: Real-Time Event & Threat Alert Lifecycle
  E->>E: Write pre-annotation evidence snapshot to disk (.jpg)
  E->>R: XADD surveillance.alerts (stable UUID alert_id)
  
  par Database Persistence
    R-->>S: Consumer group read (XREADGROUP)
    S->>P: INSERT alert ON CONFLICT (alert_id) DO NOTHING
    S->>R: XACK surveillance.alerts
  and Real-Time Web Push
    R-->>G: Stream tail read (XREAD)
    G->>P: Hydrate alert metadata (bounded 50ms fallback)
    G-->>U: alert.created (Sub-50ms WebSocket Broadcast)
  end

  Note over U: Operator Alert Presentation
  U->>U: Render high-priority toast, play alert audio chime
  
  opt Transactional Email Notification
    N->>P: Query un-notified critical alerts (anti-join)
    N-->>N: Render HTML email with inline evidence snapshot
    N->>P: UPDATE alert SET notified_at = NOW()
  end

  Note over U,G: Single-Winner Acknowledgement Flow (ADR 0016)
  U->>G: PATCH /api/v1/alerts/:id/acknowledge (REST)
  G->>P: UPDATE alerts SET status = 'ACKNOWLEDGED' WHERE id = :id AND status = 'OPEN'
  G-->>U: alert.updated (Broadcast to all active operator sessions)
